┌─ base @ 320px
<div>
  <dialog
    open
    style="
      animation: dialog-open-scale var(--motion-duration-medium-3) var(--motion-easing-standard), dialog-open-opacity var(--motion-duration-short-3) var(--motion-easing-continuous);
      background-color: var(--color-background-primary);
      border-bottom-color: currentcolor;
      border-bottom-style: none;
      border-bottom-width: medium;
      border-left-color: currentcolor;
      border-left-style: none;
      border-left-width: medium;
      border-right-color: currentcolor;
      border-right-style: none;
      border-right-width: medium;
      border-top-color: currentcolor;
      border-top-style: none;
      border-top-width: medium;
      color: var(--color-foreground-primary);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      max-height: 90%;
      max-width: 88%;
      min-height: 55px;
      min-width: 208px;
      padding-bottom: 0px;
      padding-left: 0px;
      padding-right: 0px;
      padding-top: 0px
    "
  >
    <style>@scope{:scope{
      &::backdrop {animation: dialog-open-scrim var(--motion-duration-short-3) var(--motion-easing-continuous) forwards}
    }}</style>
    <div style="
      display: flex;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      padding: var(--spacing-200) var(--spacing-200) 0;
      position: relative
    ">
      <h2 style="
        align-self: center;
        flex-grow: 1;
        margin-bottom: 0px;
        margin-top: 0px;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere
      ">
        Dialog
      </h2>
      <button style="
        align-items: center;
        align-self: flex-start;
        background-color: var(--color-background-secondary);
        border-bottom-color: currentcolor;
        border-bottom-left-radius: 50px;
        border-bottom-right-radius: 50px;
        border-bottom-style: none;
        border-bottom-width: 0px;
        border-left-color: currentcolor;
        border-left-style: none;
        border-left-width: 0px;
        border-right-color: currentcolor;
        border-right-style: none;
        border-right-width: 0px;
        border-top-color: currentcolor;
        border-top-left-radius: 50px;
        border-top-right-radius: 50px;
        border-top-style: none;
        border-top-width: 0px;
        display: inline-flex;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        font-family: inherit;
        height: 32px;
        justify-content: center;
        margin-inline-start: var(--spacing-200);
        min-width: 32px;
        overflow-x: hidden;
        overflow-y: hidden;
        padding-bottom: 0px;
        padding-left: 0px;
        padding-right: 0px;
        padding-top: 0px;
        position: relative;
        vertical-align: text-bottom;
        width: 32px;
        z-index: 1
      ">
        <style>@scope{:scope{
          &::after {
            background-color: var(--color-state-layer-focus);
            border-bottom-left-radius: 50px;
            border-bottom-right-radius: 50px;
            border-top-left-radius: 50px;
            border-top-right-radius: 50px;
            bottom: 0px;
            content: "";
            left: 0px;
            pointer-events: none;
            position: absolute;
            right: 0px;
            top: 0px
          }
        }}</style>
        <svg style="
          display: inline-block;
          fill: var(--color-foreground-primary);
          height: 16px;
          max-width: 75%;
          pointer-events: none;
          position: relative;
          stroke-width: 0;
          stroke: currentcolor;
          vertical-align: middle;
          width: 16px
        ">
          <use href="#icon-close-16"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
    <div style="
      box-sizing: border-box;
      flex-grow: 1;
      overflow-x: auto;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: var(--spacing-200);
      position: relative
    ">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0px">
        Heading
      </h3>
      <p>
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vivamus convallis molestie erat, ut adipiscing risus blandit vel. Vivamus luctus elementum lorem, eu sodales velit sagittis id.
      </p>
      <p>
        <a style="color: var(--color-foreground-link-primary)">
          www.ebay.com
        </a>
      </p>
      <h3>
        Heading
      </h3>
      <p>
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Vivamus convallis molestie erat, ut adipiscing risus blandit vel. Vivamus luctus elementum lorem, eu sodales velit sagittis id.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 0px">
        <a style="color: var(--color-foreground-link-primary)">
          www.ebay.com
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</div>

